    "detailed_description": "Tired of all those idle simulators requiring you to click things or build autoclikers?<br />\r\nWell, fear no more, this True Idle Simulator will solve all of those problems.<br />\r\nIt doesn't require you to click, spend money or do absolutely anything at all!<br />\r\nActually, it is so good at making you do nothing that it shouldn't even be called a simulator!<br />\r\nIt is truly idle hence the name, the only question is: Do you have the patience to be the best?",
